<title>USA: IPO FILING -- Delta Financial Corp.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING -- Delta Financial Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Delta Financial Corp</p>
<p>NYSE Stock symbol		   DFC.N</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $14-$16/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    4.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 4.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    14,653,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Natwest Securities Ltd</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  600,000 shrs Business: Specialty consumer finance company that has engaged in originating, acquiring, selling and servicing home equity loans since 1982.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To fund distribution of $23 million to the existing stockholders and to repay amounts outstanding under the company's warehouse lines.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s:     1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $36,135	    $21,797</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $4,586	     $2,009</p>
